  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Complementary Off-Grid Supply Solutions, through Rocky Mountain Institute</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant to Abuja Electricity Distribution PLC will fund a feasibility study that will explore the viability of implementing mini-grids with solar photovoltaic plus energy storage systems in underserved locations in Nigeria. The Study would evaluate a utility business model for building distributed energy resources designed to complement existing grid supply and prepare an implementation plan for developing financeable mini-grid projects.</narrative>
  </description>
